# P4: the 4 FX switch on Tracker+ and Mini. Project Settings, 4 FX Slots On, back to the Pattern screen: the step grid has FX3 and FX4 columns, a
# step takes an FX3 and an FX4 (the fx34 sets are core code). The list moves by `tap Down` on both (the Mini has no encoder), expect peek fxslots reads the switch.
title: 4 FX flip on Tracker+ (P4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

tap Pattern
wait 800ms
shot fx-before
expect peek fxslots 2
tap File
wait 800ms
tap F7
wait 1000ms
expect text "4 FX Slots"
tap F8
wait 600ms
tap Down
wait 600ms
tap F8
wait 3000ms
tap F7
wait 800ms
tap Pattern
wait 1000ms
shot fx-after
expect peek fxslots 4
